BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 80 252.00 Tm (double digit productivity growth within a decade. This paper asks whether such) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 80 234.00 Tm (large effects are plausible, and if they are, who is likely to benefit from them.) Tj ET
