BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 80 190.00 Tm (production is modeled as a continuum of tasks, each of which can be performed by) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 80 172.00 Tm (labor or by capital. AI enters through four channels: it can automate tasks) Tj ET
